# Bundled-test-signer keypair for CP-7.5 manifest signing in tests.
# NOT a production secret; the bundled manifests are signed with this key
# and re-signing happens at test time when fixtures are mutated.

# CP-7.5 bundled-test-signer keypair. This is a TEST key only — it signs
# the bundled test catalog manifests and the testing-external-agent-runtime
# fixture so the §7.5.1 manifest-signature gate can be exercised end-to-end.
# It is checked in deliberately so a fresh checkout can sign and verify the
# bundled manifests deterministically. Production add-on publishers will use
# their own keys held outside the repo.
!scripts/.bundled-test-signer.json
